---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const pageTitle = "The Laurel Ridge Pricing | Appalachian Sheds Inc.";
---
<Base title={pageTitle}>
<Fragment set:html={"<div class=\"asi-global-header\" role=\"banner\"><div class=\"asi-nav-shell\"><a aria-label=\"Appalachian Sheds home\" class=\"asi-brand\" href=\"/\"><strong>APPALACHIAN SHEDS INC.</strong><span>VETERAN &amp; FAMILY-OWNED \u00b7 BUILT ON SITE</span></a><button aria-controls=\"asi-nav-primary\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"asi-menu-toggle\" type=\"button\">\u2630 Menu</button><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"asi-nav-links\" id=\"asi-nav-primary\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/buildings/\">Buildings &amp; Pricing</a><a href=\"/planning-guides/\">Building Guides</a><a href=\"/options-upgrades/\">Options &amp; Upgrades</a><a href=\"/craft/\">Built Better</a><a class=\"asi-nav-cta\" href=\"/buildings/#the-collection\">See Your Price</a></nav></div></div>\n<header class=\"sitebar\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"brand\">APPALACHIAN SHEDS INC.</div><div class=\"tagline\">Veteran &amp; Family-Owned \u00a0\u2022\u00a0 Built on Site \u00a0\u2022\u00a0 Greater Cincinnati &amp; the Tri-State</div></div></header>\n<main>\n<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap hero-grid asi-standard-hero-grid\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Crafted to Complement Your Property</div><h1>The Laurel Ridge Pricing.</h1><p>The distinctive single-slope design pairs natural cedar detailing with refined exterior siding. Choose an Attached Lean-To or a completely independent Stand-Alone building, each constructed on your property.</p><div class=\"hero-points\"><span>2/12 single-slope roof</span><span>Five siding selections</span><span>Built on Site</span></div><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#configurations\">Choose Your Configuration</a><a class=\"btn outline\" href=\"#calculator\">See Your Price</a></div></div><div class=\"asi-standard-hero-media\"><img alt=\"The Laurel Ridge Attached Lean-To, with charcoal horizontal siding, natural cedar double doors and a single-slope roof beside a suburban home\" src=\"/models/laurel-ridge.jpg\"/></div></div></div>\n<section><div class=\"wrap intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">A Flexible Backyard Solution</span><h2>One distinctive design. Two ways to build.</h2><p>Whether you need an attractive extension alongside an existing structure or an independent backyard building, The Laurel Ridge brings practical storage and understated craftsmanship to your property.</p><div class=\"notice\"><strong>Exterior shell and finish requirements</strong>The standard Laurel Ridge is a weather-tight exterior shell, built on site\u2014not a fully finished interior. Insulation, electrical work, HVAC, interior wall or ceiling finishes and other improvements are not included unless specified in your written proposal. Required exterior caulking/sealing and painting or staining must be completed within 30 days of construction, as applicable to your selected materials. Our complete exterior painting service is available as an option.</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"config-section\" id=\"configurations\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">Select Your Layout</span><h2>Choose Your Configuration</h2><p class=\"section-lead\">Both Laurel Ridge configurations share a contemporary single-slope roofline and customizable exterior appearance. Their structural and site requirements differ, so each is quoted appropriately.</p><div aria-label=\"Choose Laurel Ridge configuration\" class=\"config-grid\" role=\"group\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"config-card active\" data-mode=\"attached\" type=\"button\"><small>CONFIGURATION 01</small><strong>Attached Lean-To</strong><p>A space-efficient structure beside an existing building, with 24 sizes and five available siding choices.</p><b>View Size &amp; Siding Prices \u2192</b></button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"config-card\" data-mode=\"standalone\" type=\"button\"><small>CONFIGURATION 02</small><strong>Stand-Alone Laurel Ridge</strong><p>A separate backyard structure with independent support, enclosure and anchorage. Sized and priced through a written proposal.</p><b>Explore Stand-Alone Options \u2192</b></button></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"mode-info\" id=\"config-info\">Attached Lean-To pricing is available below. All sizes are constructed on site, and attachment conditions are reviewed as part of your property evaluation.</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"sizes-section\" id=\"sizes\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">Six Convenient Starting Points</span><h2>Choose Your Size</h2><p>Explore featured Attached Lean-To configurations, or review the complete 24-size schedule below. For the Stand-Alone Laurel Ridge, tell us the size you have in mind and we'll prepare a written proposal.</p><div class=\"size-grid\"><button class=\"size-card\" data-size=\"0\" type=\"button\"><small>ATTACHED LEAN-TO</small><strong>4\u00d78\u00d78\u2032</strong><span>From $2,760</span><em>Choose This Size \u2192</em></button><button class=\"size-card\" data-size=\"4\" type=\"button\"><small>ATTACHED LEAN-TO</small><strong>6\u00d78\u00d78\u20324\u2033</strong><span>From $3,211</span><em>Choose This Size \u2192</em></button><button class=\"size-card\" data-size=\"9\" type=\"button\"><small>ATTACHED LEAN-TO</small><strong>8\u00d712\u00d78\u20328\u2033</strong><span>From $4,663</span><em>Choose This Size \u2192</em></button><button class=\"size-card\" data-size=\"13\" type=\"button\"><small>ATTACHED LEAN-TO</small><strong>10\u00d712\u00d79\u20322\u2033</strong><span>From $5,389</span><em>Choose This Size \u2192</em></button><button class=\"size-card\" data-size=\"15\" type=\"button\"><small>ATTACHED LEAN-TO</small><strong>10\u00d716\u00d79\u20322\u2033</strong><span>From $6,566</span><em>Choose This Size \u2192</em></button><button class=\"size-card\" data-size=\"19\" type=\"button\"><small>ATTACHED LEAN-TO</small><strong>12\u00d720\u00d79\u20326\u2033</strong><span>From $8,711</span><em>Choose This Size \u2192</em></button></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"calculator\" id=\"calculator\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Plan Your Building</span><h2>See Your Price</h2><div class=\"calc-grid\"><div><p>Choose a configuration, size and siding. Attached Lean-To prices update instantly; Stand-Alone structures are priced individually to reflect their independent construction requirements.</p><div class=\"fields\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"calc-mode\">Building Configuration</label><select id=\"calc-mode\"><option value=\"attached\">Attached Lean-To</option><option value=\"standalone\">Stand-Alone Laurel Ridge</option></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"calc-size\">Building Size (Width \u00d7 Length \u00d7 Approx. Height)</label><select id=\"calc-size\"></select></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"calc-siding\">Exterior Siding Selection</label><select id=\"calc-siding\"><option value=\"0\">Roseburg DuraTemp \u2014 Standard</option><option value=\"1\">LP SmartSide Vertical Textured Panel</option><option value=\"2\">LP SmartSide Board &amp; Batten</option><option value=\"3\">LP SmartSide Lap</option><option value=\"4\">GP Vinyl Lap</option></select></div></div><p class=\"smallnote\">All published prices cover the specified exterior weather-tight shell and are planning guides. Site conditions, attachment details, property access, leveling beyond included tolerances, permits, engineering, customization and additional services may affect the written proposal. All construction is performed on site.</p></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"result\"><div id=\"priced\"><small>Attached Lean-To \u2022 Guide Price</small><div class=\"price\" id=\"calc-price\">\u2014</div></div><div class=\"hidden\" id=\"proposal\"><small>Stand-Alone Laurel Ridge</small><div class=\"proposal-label\">Pricing by Written Proposal</div><p class=\"subtle\">Independent foundation, wall, roof, and anchorage requirements are evaluated for your chosen size and site.</p></div><div class=\"selection\" id=\"selection\"></div><p class=\"subtle\">Weather-tight exterior shell \u2022 Built on Site \u2022 Optional services quoted separately</p><button class=\"btn\" id=\"copy-config\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\" type=\"button\">Copy My Building Selections</button><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"copymsg\" id=\"copy-msg\"></div><a href=\"#contact\" style=\"font-size:.82rem;margin-top:7px\">Continue to request a proposal \u2193</a></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"table-section\" id=\"comparison\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">Review Your Options</span><h2>Complete Price Comparison</h2><p>Attached Lean-To pricing includes Roseburg DuraTemp as the standard siding, with four optional exterior siding upgrades. Stand-Alone Laurel Ridge pricing is available by written proposal.</p><details id=\"pricing-details\"><summary>View Full 24-Size Attached Lean-To Pricing Table</summary><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"price-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Size<br/>W \u00d7 L \u00d7 H</th><th scope=\"col\">Roseburg<br/>DuraTemp<br/>Standard</th><th scope=\"col\">LP SmartSide<br/>Vertical Textured<br/>Panel</th><th scope=\"col\">LP SmartSide<br/>Board &amp; Batten</th><th scope=\"col\">LP SmartSide<br/>Lap</th><th scope=\"col\">GP Vinyl<br/>Lap</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">4\u00d78\u00d78\u2032</th><td>$2,760</td><td>$2,981</td><td>$3,063</td><td>$3,381</td><td>$3,422</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">4\u00d710\u00d78\u2032</th><td>$3,233</td><td>$3,492</td><td>$3,589</td><td>$3,960</td><td>$4,009</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">4\u00d712\u00d78\u2032</th><td>$3,651</td><td>$3,943</td><td>$4,052</td><td>$4,472</td><td>$4,527</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6\u00d76\u00d78\u20324\u2033</th><td>$2,848</td><td>$3,076</td><td>$3,161</td><td>$3,489</td><td>$3,531</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6\u00d78\u00d78\u20324\u2033</th><td>$3,211</td><td>$3,468</td><td>$3,564</td><td>$3,933</td><td>$3,982</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6\u00d79\u00d78\u20324\u2033</th><td>$3,464</td><td>$3,741</td><td>$3,845</td><td>$4,243</td><td>$4,295</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6\u00d710\u00d78\u20324\u2033</th><td>$3,717</td><td>$4,014</td><td>$4,126</td><td>$4,553</td><td>$4,609</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6\u00d712\u00d78\u20324\u2033</th><td>$4,190</td><td>$4,525</td><td>$4,651</td><td>$5,133</td><td>$5,195</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">8\u00d710\u00d78\u20328\u2033</th><td>$4,146</td><td>$4,478</td><td>$4,602</td><td>$5,079</td><td>$5,141</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">8\u00d712\u00d78\u20328\u2033</th><td>$4,663</td><td>$5,036</td><td>$5,176</td><td>$5,712</td><td>$5,782</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">8\u00d714\u00d78\u20328\u2033</th><td>$5,279</td><td>$5,701</td><td>$5,860</td><td>$6,467</td><td>$6,546</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">8\u00d716\u00d78\u20328\u2033</th><td>$5,752</td><td>$6,212</td><td>$6,385</td><td>$7,046</td><td>$7,132</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">10\u00d710\u00d79\u20322\u2033</th><td>$4,828</td><td>$5,214</td><td>$5,359</td><td>$5,914</td><td>$5,987</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">10\u00d712\u00d79\u20322\u2033</th><td>$5,389</td><td>$5,820</td><td>$5,982</td><td>$6,601</td><td>$6,682</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">10\u00d714\u00d79\u20322\u2033</th><td>$6,049</td><td>$6,533</td><td>$6,714</td><td>$7,410</td><td>$7,501</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">10\u00d716\u00d79\u20322\u2033</th><td>$6,566</td><td>$7,091</td><td>$7,288</td><td>$8,043</td><td>$8,142</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">10\u00d720\u00d79\u20322\u2033</th><td>$7,743</td><td>$8,362</td><td>$8,595</td><td>$9,485</td><td>$9,601</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12\u00d712\u00d79\u20326\u2033</th><td>$6,071</td><td>$6,557</td><td>$6,739</td><td>$7,437</td><td>$7,528</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12\u00d716\u00d79\u20326\u2033</th><td>$7,380</td><td>$7,970</td><td>$8,192</td><td>$9,040</td><td>$9,151</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12\u00d720\u00d79\u20326\u2033</th><td>$8,711</td><td>$9,408</td><td>$9,669</td><td>$10,671</td><td>$10,802</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12\u00d724\u00d79\u20326\u2033</th><td>$10,020</td><td>$10,821</td><td>$11,122</td><td>$12,274</td><td>$12,425</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12\u00d728\u00d79\u20326\u2033</th><td>$11,318</td><td>$12,223</td><td>$12,563</td><td>$13,864</td><td>$14,034</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12\u00d730\u00d79\u20326\u2033</th><td>$11,989</td><td>$12,948</td><td>$13,308</td><td>$14,686</td><td>$14,866</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12\u00d732\u00d79\u20326\u2033</th><td>$12,583</td><td>$13,590</td><td>$13,967</td><td>$15,414</td><td>$15,603</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Prices in USD. Dimensions and approximate heights are shown in feet and inches. Written proposals confirm the final scope, construction details and project price.</p></details></div></section>\n<section class=\"standards\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">Built With Purpose</span><h2>Superior Standard Features</h2><p>Quality materials and thoughtful construction practices are foundational to every Appalachian Sheds building. Final structural details are tailored to building configuration, site conditions, and approved plans.</p><div class=\"spec-grid\"><div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"spec-icon\">\u25a6</span><strong>Foundation &amp; Support</strong><p>Pressure-treated 4\u00d76 beams on 16\u00d716\u00d74-inch solid concrete pads where applicable. Engineered support layout and anchorage follow the building's configuration and site requirements.</p></div><div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"spec-icon\">\u25a4</span><strong>Solid Floor Construction</strong><p>2\u00d76 pressure-treated floor joists at 16 inches on center and \u00be-inch pressure-treated exterior-rated plywood floor decking where included in the selected design.</p></div><div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"spec-icon\">\u25a5</span><strong>Quality Wall Framing</strong><p>2\u00d74 kiln-dried framing studs at 16 inches on center, with framing and attachment details appropriate to each configuration.</p></div><div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"spec-icon\">\u2302</span><strong>Single-Slope Roofline</strong><p>Distinctive 2/12 mono-slope roof with engineered roof structure and \u00bd-inch CDX roof sheathing. Roofing and low-slope water protection specified to suit the approved assembly.</p></div><div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"spec-icon\">\u25c7</span><strong>Exterior Character</strong><p>Choice of five siding options, distinctive cedar trim and Craftsman-style wood doors; final openings and details are identified in your proposal.</p></div><div class=\"spec\"><span class=\"spec-icon\">\u2713</span><strong>Built on Your Property</strong><p>All Laurel Ridge buildings are constructed on site. Site access, required approvals, support elevations and property conditions are reviewed in advance.</p></div></div><h3>Approximate Attached Lean-To Building Heights</h3><table class=\"height-table\"><tbody><tr><th>4-ft-wide buildings</th><td>8 ft 0 in</td></tr><tr><th>6-ft-wide buildings</th><td>8 ft 4 in</td></tr><tr><th>8-ft-wide buildings</th><td>8 ft 8 in</td></tr><tr><th>10-ft-wide buildings</th><td>9 ft 2 in</td></tr><tr><th>12-ft-wide buildings</th><td>9 ft 6 in</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size:.81rem\">Heights are approximate. Final dimensions, roof geometry and clearance depend on the selected configuration and site.</p></div><figure class=\"asi-feature-showcase\" data-approved-model=\"laurel-ridge\" data-asi-qa=\"centered-full-section-v2\"><img alt=\"Laurel Ridge \u2014 approved Superior Standard Features graphic highlighting eight model-specific construction details\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1086\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/standard-features/laurel-ridge.png\" width=\"1448\"/><figcaption>Standard features and illustrated construction details vary by model. Actual scope is confirmed in the written proposal.</figcaption></figure></section>\n<section class=\"gallery\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Explore The Laurel Ridge</span><h2>Exterior Gallery</h2><div class=\"gallery-grid\"><div><h3>Attached Lean-To</h3><img alt=\"Attached Laurel Ridge charcoal-sided lean-to with cedar double doors built beside a home\" src=\"/standard-features/laurel-ridge.png\"/><p class=\"gallery-note\">Attached configuration shown with charcoal siding and natural cedar doors.</p></div><div><h3>Stand-Alone Laurel Ridge</h3><div class=\"gallery-placeholder\">Stand-Alone exterior photographs and additional finish combinations will be added to this gallery.</div><p class=\"gallery-note\">A separate, independent building with the same distinctive Laurel Ridge design language.</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"asi-construction-heading\" class=\"asi-construction-bridge\"><div class=\"asi-construction-bridge__inner\"><div><div class=\"asi-construction-bridge__eyebrow\">Our Craftsmanship</div><h2 id=\"asi-construction-heading\">Built Better \u2014 From the Inside Out</h2><p>Explore the foundation, floor framing, wall construction, roof structure and weather protection behind Appalachian Sheds buildings. Our shared construction showcase gives you a closer look at how we build on your property.</p><a class=\"asi-construction-bridge__button\" href=\"/craft/\">Explore Our Superior Construction \u2192</a><p class=\"asi-construction-bridge__note\">Standard buildings are weather-tight exterior shells; interior finishes are not included. Required exterior caulking and painting or staining must be completed within 30 days. Optional finishing services are available.</p></div><div class=\"asi-construction-bridge__features\"><div><strong>Foundation &amp; floor</strong><span>Pressure-treated framing and solid concrete support pads</span></div><div><strong>Walls &amp; roof</strong><span>Purpose-built structure suited to the model and site</span></div><div><strong>Weather protection</strong><span>Roofing, flashing, ventilation and exterior detailing</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">Plan With Confidence</span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><details><summary>What is the difference between the Attached Lean-To and Stand-Alone Laurel Ridge?</summary><p>The Attached Lean-To is planned alongside an existing building and requires assessment of the attachment and water-management details. The Stand-Alone Laurel Ridge is a separate building with independent support and enclosure requirements. Both are constructed on site.</p></details><details><summary>Why is Stand-Alone pricing provided by written proposal?</summary><p>A separate foundation and enclosure, structural connections, roof details and site conditions influence the total. A written proposal ensures your pricing reflects the building actually planned for your property.</p></details><details><summary>Are all 24 Attached Lean-To sizes available?</summary><p>Yes, the published comparison covers all 24 listed sizes, including the 4-foot-wide options. We can also discuss other sizing needs for your property.</p></details><details><summary>Does the price include a finished interior?</summary><p>No. Standard pricing is for a weather-tight exterior shell. Interior finishes, electrical, insulation, climate control and other improvements are not included unless they are expressly included in your written proposal.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to paint or stain the exterior?</summary><p>Required exterior caulking/sealing and painting or staining must be completed within 30 days of construction as applicable to the siding and trim selected. Appalachian Sheds offers an optional complete exterior painting service.</p></details><details><summary>Are Laurel Ridge buildings constructed on site?</summary><p>Every Laurel Ridge is constructed on site. Our team reviews access, conditions and placement before the work begins.</p></details><details><summary>Will the guide price be my final contract price?</summary><p>The guide helps you compare Attached Lean-To sizes and siding options. Your written proposal confirms the scope, site requirements, selected upgrades and final project price.</p></details></div></section>\n<section class=\"final\" id=\"contact\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Your Property. Your Laurel Ridge.</span><h2>Let's Plan Your Laurel Ridge</h2><p>Choose your preferred configuration, size and siding, then contact Appalachian Sheds to review your site and request a detailed written proposal.</p><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"copy-footer\" type=\"button\">Copy My Selections</button><a class=\"btn outline\" href=\"https://appalachiansheds.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Contact Appalachian Sheds</a></div><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"contacthelp\" id=\"footer-msg\">Copy your selections to include when contacting our team.</p></div></section>\n</main><section class=\"sand pad\" id=\"utility-services\"><div class=\"shell\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Complete Your Project</span><h2>Need Electrical, Plumbing, Insulation, or Site Prep?</h2><p>Appalachian Sheds’ own licensed crews can wire, plumb, insulate, and prepare your site — all priced transparently, with a bundle discount when combined.</p><div class=\"buttons\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/services/utility-and-site-readiness/\">See Utility &amp; Site Readiness Pricing →</a></div></div></section>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"wrap\">\u00a9 Appalachian Sheds Inc. \u00a0\u2022\u00a0 Veteran &amp; Family-Owned \u00a0\u2022\u00a0 Built on Site in the Greater Cincinnati Tri-State</div></footer>\n\n"} />
</Base>

